    Return a text, 'the companion'.

(Which variable a named lookup asks for. LANGUAGE.md:4483-4494 reads
 HOME, USER and SHELL by name; a generated program asks for those and for
 other names a process usually has, chosen at random - the leaf never
 assumes any of them is set. A VOXFUZZ_UNSET_ name is the other case:
 invented here, set by nobody, so its absence IS known.)

